   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "at-least-once -> idempotent consume",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "at-least-once -> idempotent consume",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t636991959",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 700.0,
   "y": 22,
   "width": 542.3000000000001,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1818553371,
   "versionNonce": 17915230,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ch.20 \u2014 the dual-write hazard vs. the transactional outbox",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "ch.20 \u2014 the dual-write hazard vs. the transactional outbox",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 17
  },
  {
   "id": "t1502628220",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 262,
   "width": 992.2,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 200539530,
   "versionNonce": 1054199049,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A crash, a client timeout, or a pod reschedule in the gap between the two writes leaves one system updated and the other not \u2014 nothing is watching for the mismatch.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "A crash, a client timeout, or a pod reschedule in the gap between the two writes leaves one system updated and the other not \u2014 nothing is watching for the mismatch.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1904059975",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 278,
   "width": 1028.5,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 324337574,
   "versionNonce": 131786424,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Reversing the order (publish, then save) relocates the same gap; it does not close it. No sequencing of two independent writes to two independent systems closes this gap.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Reversing the order (publish, then save) relocates the same gap; it does not close it. No sequencing of two independent writes to two independent systems closes this gap.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t344717547",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 745,
   "width": 949.85,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1158542214,
   "versionNonce": 1436134959,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The second hop (table to broker) is still separate \u2014 but now explicit, bounded, and owned by one piece of infrastructure, not hidden inside application code.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The second hop (table to broker) is still separate \u2014 but now explicit, bounded, and owned by one piece of infrastructure, not hidden inside application code.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1626567330",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 761,
   "width": 901.45,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 897654159,
   "versionNonce": 619460837,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "At-least-once delivery out of the relay is only safe because the consumer on the far side is idempotent (check-then-insert, deduped by aggregate id).",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "At-least-once delivery out of the relay is only safe because the consumer on the far side is idempotent (check-then-insert, deduped by aggregate id).",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
